 *       drop the space before wiring it here.
 *   - zain-horse-mat-applications.jpg             (1024×1024, exact match)
 *   - zain-horse-mat-dubai-geographic-signals.jpg (1408×768, exact match)
 * TODO: convert to optimised WebP; add a purpose-built 1200×630 OG card
 * (og:image currently falls back to the hero file).
 */
